{"seq":4,"slug":"thread-pools","title":"线程池与任务调度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/threads-concurrency/supplementary/thread-pools","wordCount":979,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"线程池与任务调度\">线程池与任务调度</h1><h2 id=\"问题描述\">问题描述</h2><p>在并发程序中，频繁创建和销毁线程会带来显著的性能开销——每次创建线程都需要分配内存、初始化栈空间和系统资源，销毁时还需要回收这些资源。当任务数量大、单个任务执行时间短时，线程管理的开销甚至可能超过任务本身的执行时间。</p>\n<p><strong>线程池（Thread Pool）</strong> 通过预先创建一组线程并复用它们来执行任务，从而避免了反复创建和销毁线程的开销。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph Without Thread Pool&#10;        direction TB&#10;        T1[&quot;Task 1 → Create Thread → Execute → Destroy&quot;]&#10;        T2[&quot;Task 2 → Create Thread → Execute → Destroy&quot;]&#10;        T3[&quot;Task 3 → Create Thread → Execute → Destroy&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph With Thread Pool&#10;        direction TB&#10;        Q[&quot;Task Queue&lt;br/&gt;📋&quot;] --&gt; W1[&quot;Worker 1 (Reused)&quot;]&#10;        Q --&gt; W2[&quot;Worker 2 (Reused)&quot;]&#10;        Q --&gt; W3[&quot;Worker 3 (Reused)&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph Without Thread Pool\n        direction TB\n        T1[\"Task 1 → Create Thread → Execute → Destroy\"]\n        T2[\"Task 2 → Create Thread → Execute → Destroy\"]\n        T3[\"Task 3 → Create Thread → Execute → Destroy\"]\n    end\n    subgraph With Thread Pool\n        direction TB\n        Q[\"Task Queue&lt;br/&gt;📋\"] --&gt; W1[\"Worker 1 (Reused)\"]\n        Q --&gt; W2[\"Worker 2 (Reused)\"]\n        Q --&gt; W3[\"Worker 3 (Reused)\"]\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"线程池的组成\">线程池的组成</h3><p>线程池由三个核心组件构成：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">组件</th>\n<th align=\"left\">说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>任务队列（Task Queue）</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">存放等待执行的任务，通常是 FIFO 队列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>工作线程（Worker Threads）</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">预先创建的线程，从队列中取任务并执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>池管理器（Pool Manager）</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">控制线程池的生命周期、线程数量和调度策略</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph Thread Pool Structure&#10;        SUBMIT[&quot;📨 Submit Task&quot;] --&gt; TQ[&quot;📋 Task Queue&lt;br/&gt;FIFO&quot;]&#10;        TQ --&gt; W1[&quot;👷 Worker 1&quot;]&#10;        TQ --&gt; W2[&quot;👷 Worker 2&quot;]&#10;        TQ --&gt; W3[&quot;👷 Worker 3&quot;]&#10;        TQ --&gt; W4[&quot;👷 Worker 4&quot;]&#10;        MGR[&quot;🎛️ Pool Manager&quot;] -.-&gt;|&quot;Monitor &amp; Schedule&quot;| TQ&#10;        MGR -.-&gt;|&quot;Manage Thread Count&quot;| W1&#10;    end\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph Thread Pool Structure\n        SUBMIT[\"📨 Submit Task\"] --&gt; TQ[\"📋 Task Queue&lt;br/&gt;FIFO\"]\n        TQ --&gt; W1[\"👷 Worker 1\"]\n        TQ --&gt; W2[\"👷 Worker 2\"]\n        TQ --&gt; W3[\"👷 Worker 3\"]\n        TQ --&gt; W4[\"👷 Worker 4\"]\n        MGR[\"🎛️ Pool Manager\"] -.-&gt;|\"Monitor &amp; Schedule\"| TQ\n        MGR -.-&gt;|\"Manage Thread Count\"| W1\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"工作线程的执行循环\">工作线程的执行循环</h3><p>每个工作线程的核心逻辑非常简单：不断从任务队列中取出任务并执行。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"函数 Worker线程执行循环(taskQueue):&#10;    循环:&#10;        task = taskQueue.阻塞取出()    // 队列为空时阻塞等待&#10;        如果 task == 终止信号:&#10;            退出循环&#10;        尝试:&#10;            task.执行()&#10;        捕获异常 error:&#10;            记录错误(error)&#10;            // Worker 不会因为单个任务失败而终止\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>函数 Worker线程执行循环(taskQueue):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    循环:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        task = taskQueue.阻塞取出()    // 队列为空时阻塞等待</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        如果 task == 终止信号:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            退出循环</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        尝试:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            task.执行()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        捕获异常 error:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            记录错误(error)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            // Worker 不会因为单个任务失败而终止</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"典型场景\">典型场景</h2><h3 id=\"任务提交流程\">任务提交流程</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    START[&quot;Submit Task&quot;] --&gt; CHECK{&quot;Is queue full?&quot;}&#10;    CHECK --&gt;|&quot;No&quot;| ENQUEUE[&quot;Enqueue Task&quot;]&#10;    CHECK --&gt;|&quot;Yes&quot;| REJECT[&quot;Rejection Policy&quot;]&#10;    ENQUEUE --&gt; NOTIFY[&quot;Notify Worker&quot;]&#10;    NOTIFY --&gt; WORKER{&quot;Is there an idle Worker?&quot;}&#10;    WORKER --&gt;|&quot;Yes&quot;| EXEC[&quot;Worker dequeues and executes task&quot;]&#10;    WORKER --&gt;|&quot;No&quot;| WAIT[&quot;Task waits in queue&quot;]&#10;    WAIT --&gt; EXEC&#10;    EXEC --&gt; DONE[&quot;Task Completed&quot;]&#10;    DONE --&gt; NEXT[&quot;Worker picks up the next task&quot;]&#10;    REJECT --&gt; R1[&quot;Discard Task&quot;]&#10;    REJECT --&gt; R2[&quot;Caller Runs&quot;]&#10;    REJECT --&gt; R3[&quot;Discard Oldest Task in Queue&quot;]&#10;    REJECT --&gt; R4[&quot;Throw Exception&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    START[\"Submit Task\"] --&gt; CHECK{\"Is queue full?\"}\n    CHECK --&gt;|\"No\"| ENQUEUE[\"Enqueue Task\"]\n    CHECK --&gt;|\"Yes\"| REJECT[\"Rejection Policy\"]\n    ENQUEUE --&gt; NOTIFY[\"Notify Worker\"]\n    NOTIFY --&gt; WORKER{\"Is there an idle Worker?\"}\n    WORKER --&gt;|\"Yes\"| EXEC[\"Worker dequeues and executes task\"]\n    WORKER --&gt;|\"No\"| WAIT[\"Task waits in queue\"]\n    WAIT --&gt; EXEC\n    EXEC --&gt; DONE[\"Task Completed\"]\n    DONE --&gt; NEXT[\"Worker picks up the next task\"]\n    REJECT --&gt; R1[\"Discard Task\"]\n    REJECT --&gt; R2[\"Caller Runs\"]\n    REJECT --&gt; R3[\"Discard Oldest Task in Queue\"]\n    REJECT --&gt; R4[\"Throw Exception\"]</pre><h3 id=\"线程池大小策略\">线程池大小策略</h3><p>线程池大小的选择直接影响系统性能。过小会导致任务排队等待，过大会导致线程间竞争和上下文切换开销。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">任务类型</th>\n<th align=\"left\">推荐池大小</th>\n<th align=\"left\">说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>CPU 密集型</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">CPU 核心数 + 1</td>\n<td align=\"left\">线程主要做计算，多了反而增加上下文切换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>IO 密集型</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">CPU 核心数 × 2 ~ 4</td>\n<td align=\"left\">线程经常等待 IO，多线程可提高 CPU 利用率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>混合型</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">根据 IO 等待比例调整</td>\n<td align=\"left\">等待时间越长，可配置更多线程</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"// 池大小计算公式（参考值）&#10;最优线程数 = CPU核心数 × (1 + 平均等待时间 / 平均计算时间)&#10;&#10;// 示例：4 核 CPU，任务平均等 200ms、算 100ms&#10;最优线程数 = 4 × (1 + 200 / 100) = 12\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 池大小计算公式（参考值）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>最优线程数 = CPU核心数 × (1 + 平均等待时间 / 平均计算时间)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 示例：4 核 CPU，任务平均等 200ms、算 100ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>最优线程数 = 4 × (1 + 200 / 100) = 12</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"动态线程池\">动态线程池</h3><p>更高级的线程池支持动态调整线程数量：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph Dynamic Thread Pool&#10;        direction TB&#10;        CORE[&quot;Core Threads&lt;br/&gt;4 (Permanent)&quot;]&#10;        MAX[&quot;Max Threads&lt;br/&gt;8&quot;]&#10;        CORE --&gt;|&quot;Task surge&lt;br/&gt;Queue backlog&quot;| EXPAND[&quot;Scale up to 8&quot;]&#10;        EXPAND --&gt;|&quot;Tasks decrease&lt;br/&gt;Idle timeout&quot;| SHRINK[&quot;Scale down to 4&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph Dynamic Thread Pool\n        direction TB\n        CORE[\"Core Threads&lt;br/&gt;4 (Permanent)\"]\n        MAX[\"Max Threads&lt;br/&gt;8\"]\n        CORE --&gt;|\"Task surge&lt;br/&gt;Queue backlog\"| EXPAND[\"Scale up to 8\"]\n        EXPAND --&gt;|\"Tasks decrease&lt;br/&gt;Idle timeout\"| SHRINK[\"Scale down to 4\"]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">参数</th>\n<th align=\"left\">说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>核心线程数</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">池中始终保持的最少线程数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>最大线程数</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">池中允许的最大线程数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>空闲超时</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">非核心线程空闲多久后被回收</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>队列容量</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">任务队列的最大长度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>拒绝策略</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">队列满且线程数已达上限时的处理方式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"解决方案\">解决方案</h2><h3 id=\"拒绝策略\">拒绝策略</h3><p>当任务队列已满且线程数达到上限时，需要执行拒绝策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">策略</th>\n<th align=\"left\">说明</th>\n<th align=\"left\">适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>丢弃（Discard）</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">直接丢弃新任务</td>\n<td align=\"left\">允许丢失非关键任务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>调用者执行（Caller Runs）</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">由提交任务的线程自己执行</td>\n<td align=\"left\">需要反压（back-pressure）机制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>丢弃最旧（Discard Oldest）</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">丢弃队列中最旧的任务，加入新任务</td>\n<td align=\"left\">新任务更重要</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>抛出异常（Abort）</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">抛出异常通知调用者</td>\n<td align=\"left\">不允许任务丢失</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"线程池的-typescript-抽象\">线程池的 TypeScript 抽象</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface Task {&#10;  id: string;&#10;  execute(): Promise&lt;void&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface ThreadPoolConfig {&#10;  coreSize: number;&#10;  maxSize: number;&#10;  queueCapacity: number;&#10;  idleTimeout: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface ThreadPool {&#10;  submit(task: Task): Promise&lt;void&gt;;&#10;  shutdown(): Promise&lt;void&gt;;&#10;  getActiveCount(): number;&#10;  getQueueSize(): number;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Task</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  execute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ThreadPoolConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  coreSize</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  maxSize</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  queueCapacity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  idleTimeout</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ThreadPool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  submit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">task</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Task</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  shutdown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  getActiveCount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  getQueueSize</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"函数 创建线程池(config):&#10;    workers = []&#10;    taskQueue = 新建有界队列(config.queueCapacity)&#10;&#10;    // 创建核心线程&#10;    重复 config.coreSize 次:&#10;        worker = 新建 Worker线程(taskQueue)&#10;        worker.启动()&#10;        workers.添加(worker)&#10;&#10;    返回 {&#10;        submit(task):&#10;            如果 taskQueue 未满:&#10;                taskQueue.放入(task)&#10;            否则如果 workers.数量 &lt; config.maxSize:&#10;                worker = 新建 Worker线程(taskQueue)&#10;                worker.启动()&#10;                workers.添加(worker)&#10;                taskQueue.放入(task)&#10;            否则:&#10;                执行拒绝策略(task)&#10;&#10;        shutdown():&#10;            对于 workers 中的每个 worker:&#10;                taskQueue.放入(终止信号)&#10;            等待所有 worker 结束&#10;    }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>函数 创建线程池(config):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    workers = []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    taskQueue = 新建有界队列(config.queueCapacity)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 创建核心线程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    重复 config.coreSize 次:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        worker = 新建 Worker线程(taskQueue)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        worker.启动()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        workers.添加(worker)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    返回 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        submit(task):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            如果 taskQueue 未满:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                taskQueue.放入(task)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            否则如果 workers.数量 &#x3C; config.maxSize:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                worker = 新建 Worker线程(taskQueue)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                worker.启动()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                workers.添加(worker)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                taskQueue.放入(task)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            否则:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                执行拒绝策略(task)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        shutdown():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            对于 workers 中的每个 worker:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                taskQueue.放入(终止信号)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            等待所有 worker 结束</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"线程池的优缺点\">线程池的优缺点</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">方面</th>\n<th align=\"left\">优点</th>\n<th align=\"left\">缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>性能</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">避免频繁创建/销毁线程</td>\n<td align=\"left\">池大小不当会影响性能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>资源控制</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">限制最大并发数</td>\n<td align=\"left\">需要合理配置参数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>响应速度</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">任务提交后可立即执行</td>\n<td align=\"left\">队列满时任务可能被拒绝</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>管理</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">统一管理线程生命周期</td>\n<td align=\"left\">增加了系统复杂度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>线程池是管理并发任务的核心基础设施：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>核心思想</strong>：预创建线程并复用，通过任务队列解耦任务提交和执行</li>\n<li><strong>三大组件</strong>：任务队列（缓冲任务）、工作线程（执行任务）、池管理器（调度控制）</li>\n<li><strong>池大小选择</strong>：CPU 密集型任务选择接近核心数的线程数，IO 密集型任务可适当增加</li>\n<li><strong>动态调整</strong>：支持核心线程数和最大线程数的弹性配置，空闲线程可自动回收</li>\n<li><strong>拒绝策略</strong>：队列满时需要明确的处理策略，如丢弃、调用者执行或抛出异常</li>\n<li>合理配置的线程池能显著提升系统吞吐量和资源利用率</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"线程池与任务调度","id":"线程池与任务调度"},{"level":2,"text":"问题描述","id":"问题描述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"线程池的组成","id":"线程池的组成"},{"level":3,"text":"工作线程的执行循环","id":"工作线程的执行循环"},{"level":2,"text":"典型场景","id":"典型场景"},{"level":3,"text":"任务提交流程","id":"任务提交流程"},{"level":3,"text":"线程池大小策略","id":"线程池大小策略"},{"level":3,"text":"动态线程池","id":"动态线程池"},{"level":2,"text":"解决方案","id":"解决方案"},{"level":3,"text":"拒绝策略","id":"拒绝策略"},{"level":3,"text":"线程池的 TypeScript 抽象","id":"线程池的-typescript-抽象"},{"level":3,"text":"线程池的优缺点","id":"线程池的优缺点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"信号量与条件变量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/threads-concurrency/supplementary/semaphores-and-conditions"},"next":{"title":"消息传递","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/threads-concurrency/supplementary/message-passing"}}